---
---

<section class="s team" id="team" style="--bg:var(--bone);--fg:var(--ink)">
  <div class="w">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our team</p>
    <h2 class="big">The people behind the work.</h2>
    <p class="aside">A small, senior team across software, telecalling and data &mdash; working as one.</p>
    <ul class="rows">
      <li class="row"><span class="rn">Executive Leadership</span><span class="rr">Managing Director</span></li>
      <li class="row"><span class="rn">Operations &amp; Delivery</span><span class="rr">Managing Director</span></li>
      <li class="row"><span class="rn">Process &amp; Quality</span><span class="rr">Consultant</span></li>
      <li class="row"><span class="rn">Client Partnerships</span><span class="rr">Consultant</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .team {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 11vw, 10rem);
  }
  .rows {
    margin-top: clamp(36px, 6vw, 72px);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(20, 32, 31, .2);
  }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 6px 24px;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 34px) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(20, 32, 31, .2);
  }
  .rn {
    font: 700 clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 4.6rem)/1.05 var(--disp);
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
  }
  .rr {
    font-size: 14px;
    opacity: .65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .row {
      padding-block: 18px;
    }
    .rr {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
